{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror adventure set in a school at midnight. Explore freely in 3D, uncovering clues to the Seven Mysteries hidden within. Your choices lead to different endings. In the silence of the halls, face eerie phenomena\u2014can you survive until dawn?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said that if you uncover all seven mysteries, your wish will be granted...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Believing in the rumor, a lone girl sets off on her adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with the mysterious ghost \u201cHanako,\u201d who suddenly appears, she wanders the school at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of her harrowing journey, what truth will she discover...?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947690?t=1765015502","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947690?t=1765015502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947690/0b74231b48fbecfa09f92fb1b6e415c060d7d932/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765015502","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947690/0b74231b48fbecfa09f92fb1b6e415c060d7d932/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765015502","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror adventure set in a school at midnight. Explore freely in 3D, uncovering clues to the Seven Mysteries hidden within. Your choices lead to different endings. In the silence of the halls, face eerie phenomena\u2014can you survive until dawn?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said that if you uncover all seven mysteries, your wish will be granted...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Believing in the rumor,